  "description": "Fills template PDFs with text, images and barcodes, in process. Placeholders are ordinary AcroForm fields; values are drawn into the page content and the form is stripped, so the output is flat and renders identically in every viewer. A permissively licensed alternative to the commercial PDF components, with no per-document cost.",
